{"id":"combate","lemma":"combate","pos":"noun","rank":1465,"glosses":["combat"],"ipa":"/komˈbate/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"combates"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-combate.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom murió en combate.","en":"Tom died in combat.","words":[null,{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"La vida es un combate contra la muerte.","en":"Life is a battle against death.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"death"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"the game"]]},{"text":"El combate duró una semana.","en":"The fighting lasted one week.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to last","l":"durar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"week"}]},{"text":"Sé que Tom era un piloto de combate.","en":"I know Tom used to be a fighter pilot.","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"pilot"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Dentro de poco, nuevos soldados remplazarán a los que cayeron en combate.","en":"New soldiers would soon take the place of those lost in battle.","words":[null,null,{"g":"little, not much"},{"g":"new","l":"nuevo"},{"g":"soldier","l":"soldado"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"in / on"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"in, inside"]]}]}